+# Harness portfolio integration — 2026-11-14
+
+Scope: one developer-tools portfolio card, homepage discovery and TH/EN/zh-Hans case-study routes.
+Existing SPACE8 LABS styles and scripts were refreshed from the concurrent site task before final checks.
+No identity, hosting, contact delivery or tracking changes. No new image/font assets.
+
+- Astro build: 38 pages, zero type errors.
+- Static verification: 38 HTML routes; harness routes, game links, locale alternates and filters checked.
+- Browser: 42/42 checks, three locales, 320/375/768/1024/1440/1920 px, both themes, tools/all filters.
+- Keyboard Enter activates tools filter, aria-pressed true, only harness visible.
+- Reduced-motion emulation: matches true, decorative canvas unpainted.
+- No browser console errors observed on the final case study.
+- Sample lead-text/background contrast minimum 9.29:1; not a claim of a full-site WCAG audit.
+- Local preview only. External release has not been performed.
+- Token savings and additional engine support are explicitly not claimed.
+
+Evidence: `docs/qa-evidence/harness/browser-results.json` and local screenshot artifacts.
